 font-bold mb-2 group-hover:text-teal transition-colors leading-snug\",\"children\":\"Shadow AI: What It Is, Why It's Dangerous, and How to Find It\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"font-body text-mid-gray text-xs\",\"children\":\"7 min read\"}]]}]]}]]}]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"$L17\",null,{\"headline\":\"Ready to Audit Your AI Stack?\",\"subhead\":\"Professional AI security audit reports starting at $499. Delivered in 5 business days.\",\"primaryCTA\":{\"label\":\"Book a Free Discovery Call\",\"href\":\"https://calendly.com\"},\"secondaryCTA\":{\"label\":\"See Audit Service\",\"href\":\"/audit\"}}]\nc:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\n18:I[622,[],\"IconMark\"]\na:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"NIST AI RMF 1.0 Explained in Plain English | AITrustAudit.com\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"The NIST AI Risk Management Framework is the federal government's guidance for managing AI risk. Here's what it actually says, how it's structured, and how to apply it in a real audit context — without the government-document fog.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"author\",\"href\":\"https://www.aitrustaudit.com/about\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Jamel Rainey\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"4\",{\"rel\":\"manifest\",\"href\":\"/site.webmanifest\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"NIST AI RMF,AI security,AI audit,AITrustAudit\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"name\":\"googlebot\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"article:author\",\"content\":\"Jamel Rainey\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"NIST AI RMF 1.0 Explained in Plain English | AITrustAudit.com\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"The NIST AI Risk Management Framework is the federal government's guidance for managing AI risk. Here's what it actually says, how it's structured, and how to apply it in a real audit context — without the government-document fog.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"article:published_time\",\"content\":\"2026-05-04T11:42:16.977Z\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"property\":\"article:author\",\"content\":\"Jamel Rainey\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"AI Security Engineering Learning Platform | AITrustAudit.com\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Practitioner-level courses and tools for AI security engineering. Built for professionals who have to do the actual work.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"17\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://www.aitrustaudit.com/og-default.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"18\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\",\"sizes\":\"16x16\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"19\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.svg\",\"type\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"20\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.svg\"}],[\"$\",\"$L18\",\"21\",{}]],\"error\":null,\"digest\":\"$undefined\"}\nf:\"$a:metadata\"\n"}